<view class="page-shell schedule-page">
  <view class="schedule-hero">
    <image src="/assets/images/stage-backdrop.jpg" mode="aspectFill" />
    <view class="schedule-hero-shade"></view>
    <view class="schedule-hero-copy">
      <view class="schedule-status"><view></view><text>{{eventState}}</text></view>
      <text class="eyebrow">THE WEDDING DAY</text>
      <text class="schedule-title serif">婚礼流程</text>
      <text class="schedule-date">{{wedding.dateDisplay}} · {{wedding.venue.name}}</text>
      <button class="calendar-button pressable" bindtap="addToCalendar"><text>加入日历</text><text>＋</text></button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section timeline-section">
    <view class="chapter-row"><text class="chapter-index">PROGRAMME</text><text class="eyebrow">TIMELINE</text></view>
    <text class="section-heading">灯光依次亮起</text>
    <text class="section-copy">婚礼当天，当前环节会被聚光灯点亮。建议提前 30 分钟到场。</text>

    <view class="timeline">
      <view class="timeline-item {{activeIndex === index ? 'is-active' : ''}} {{activeIndex > index ? 'is-past' : ''}}" wx:for="{{wedding.schedule}}" wx:key="time">
        <view class="timeline-light">
          <view class="light-beam"></view>
          <view class="timeline-dot"></view>
          <view wx:if="{{index !== wedding.schedule.length - 1}}" class="timeline-line"></view>
        </view>
        <view class="timeline-content">
          <view class="timeline-head">
            <text class="timeline-time serif">{{item.time}}</text>
            <text wx:if="{{activeIndex === index}}" class="live-label">NOW</text>
          </view>
          <text class="timeline-title serif">{{item.title}}</text>
          <text class="timeline-copy">{{item.detail}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section activities-section light-chapter">
    <view class="chapter-row"><text class="chapter-index">PARTICIPATE</text><text class="eyebrow">ACTIVITIES</text></view>
    <text class="section-heading">不只是旁观</text>
    <text class="section-copy">拍下一张照片、留下一段声音，让你也成为婚礼故事的一部分。</text>
    <view class="activity-list">
      <view class="activity-row line-card pressable" wx:for="{{activities}}" wx:key="index" bindtap="openInteract">
        <text class="activity-index serif">{{item.index}}</text>
        <view class="activity-main">
          <text class="activity-title serif">{{item.title}}</text>
          <text class="activity-copy">{{item.copy}}</text>
        </view>
        <text class="activity-arrow">↗</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="guide-section">
    <image src="/assets/images/handover-stage.jpg" mode="aspectFill" />
    <view class="guide-shade"></view>
    <view class="guide-content">
      <view class="chapter-row"><text class="chapter-index">GUEST NOTES</text><text class="eyebrow">GUIDE</text></view>
      <text class="guide-title serif">宾客指南</text>
      <view class="guide-grid">
        <view class="guide-item"><text>建议着装</text><text class="serif">黑 / 深蓝 / 银白</text></view>
        <view class="guide-item"><text>抵达时间</text><text class="serif">仪式前 30 分钟</text></view>
      </view>
      <view class="guide-note"><text>温馨提示</text><text>仪式期间请将手机调至静音；拍照时请勿使用闪光灯。</text></view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="safe-bottom"></view>
</view>
